  "title": "Vegetable and Farfel Kugel",
  "description": "Matzo farfel stands in for egg noodles in this savory vegetable kugel that&#39;s a welcome addition for a Passover meal.",
  "authors": [
    "Alice Waugh"
  ],
  "date_published": "2019-04-28T23:47:44-04:00",
